  "worked_solution": "The solid is an **oblique cylinder**. \n\nNotice the following:\n\n- The solid has two parallel circular bases. So, it's a cylinder.\n\n- The axis that passes through the centers of the circles is not perpendicular to the bases. So, it's oblique, not right.",
